WEBVTT

00:00:14.615 --> 00:00:17.055
It's too dark, and hard to walk here!

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:21.825
How come we have to go through this?!

00:00:21.825 --> 00:00:24.795
They'll be coming across
our car right around now.

00:00:24.795 --> 00:00:27.465
I'd like to avoid as much danger
as we can from here on.

00:00:27.465 --> 00:00:29.725
You seem pretty used to this, huh?

00:00:31.565 --> 00:00:34.905
Once we get over this mountain,
we'll be at the sea.

00:00:34.905 --> 00:00:37.035
Just tough it out a little longer.

00:00:44.515 --> 00:00:47.675
What are you waiting for?
Let's hurry up and get going!

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.345
Oh, this is nasty!

00:00:54.755 --> 00:00:59.865
I wonder what ISDA is
trying to do to the Dragons.

00:00:59.865 --> 00:01:06.005
I don't know, but it's probably nothing good.

00:01:06.005 --> 00:01:09.375
If they have the technology
to give life to Dragons,

00:01:09.375 --> 00:01:11.735
then naturally, the reverse is true, too.

00:01:19.445 --> 00:01:23.515
Wait! I haven't yet...

00:01:28.195 --> 00:01:31.385
I wonder why it had to come to this.

00:01:33.795 --> 00:01:35.525
Gio?

00:01:51.045 --> 00:01:56.755
Osanai hi ni nakushita

00:01:56.755 --> 00:02:02.625
sono itami no imi sae

00:02:02.625 --> 00:02:08.395
Uzumakumatte takushita

00:02:08.395 --> 00:02:11.595
Boku wa kitto...

00:02:12.965 --> 00:02:19.305
Ao no hate ni mita yokan wo toraete

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:26.815
kaze ni nori hikari no sasu hou e

00:02:26.815 --> 00:02:29.685
I'll always be with you

00:02:29.685 --> 00:02:32.325
see the sky in front of you

00:02:32.325 --> 00:02:36.695
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:02:38.425 --> 00:02:43.865
Uzumaku hoshi no hibiki ni nosete

00:02:43.865 --> 00:02:46.535
utau yo

00:02:46.535 --> 00:02:55.205
Kono koe ga kimi ni todokimasu you ni

00:03:11.895 --> 00:03:15.395
You haven't found out where they went yet?

00:03:15.395 --> 00:03:18.465
The search party is tracking them down now.

00:03:18.465 --> 00:03:21.735
They should be contacting me shortly.

00:03:21.735 --> 00:03:24.245
They keep running away, all over the place.

00:03:24.245 --> 00:03:28.845
I'd like to assign you two to a different task.

00:03:28.845 --> 00:03:31.415
A different task?

00:03:31.415 --> 00:03:34.045
An operating test with the Aegis.

00:03:35.555 --> 00:03:37.585
Aegis?

00:03:37.585 --> 00:03:40.895
Aegis, huh?

00:03:40.895 --> 00:03:44.525
I see...

00:03:44.525 --> 00:03:48.425
Acknowledged. We will
set about our task at once.

00:04:14.025 --> 00:04:16.965
How long are they planning to
keep us shut up in this place?!

00:04:16.965 --> 00:04:18.625
We're getting moldy in here!

00:04:18.625 --> 00:04:20.865
Calm down, Howling Star.

00:04:20.865 --> 00:04:23.605
If I could incarnate,
these walls would be nothing!

00:04:23.605 --> 00:04:28.775
Inside this powerful CSS field,
you are unlikely to achieve that.

00:04:28.775 --> 00:04:31.305
Damn it!

00:04:31.305 --> 00:04:33.715
I understand how impatient you feel.

00:04:33.715 --> 00:04:38.945
While we're in here like this,
Thanatos is drawing ever closer.

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:42.485
It's more important to ISDA
to hunt down Dragons

00:04:42.485 --> 00:04:45.925
and gain favor with the public right now.

00:04:45.925 --> 00:04:49.495
To think that the Dragonauts,
the world's heroes,

00:04:49.495 --> 00:04:51.965
have been reduced to being the villains!

00:04:54.465 --> 00:04:57.725
Those guys are the only ones who are still safe.

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:13.345
We've been walking around all
night long. She's short on sleep.

00:05:13.345 --> 00:05:15.815
I-I'm not really tired!

00:05:15.815 --> 00:05:17.515
Here it comes.

00:05:19.685 --> 00:05:21.655
Right on time.

00:05:21.655 --> 00:05:23.925
We'd be out of commission otherwise.

00:05:29.965 --> 00:05:32.865
- Jin!
- But Gio isn't here yet!

00:05:32.865 --> 00:05:37.775
Hurry! If the patrol boats see us,
this will all be for nothing!

00:05:48.355 --> 00:05:51.215
I'm sure Gio will be coming.

00:05:54.995 --> 00:05:57.625
Long time no see, everyone.

00:05:57.625 --> 00:05:59.965
Why are you?

00:05:59.965 --> 00:06:04.305
If you're going to attack Tartarus,
the more help you've got, the better.

00:06:04.305 --> 00:06:08.305
We haven't given up on the
possibility of Dragons and humans

00:06:08.305 --> 00:06:10.545
being able to coexist.

00:06:10.545 --> 00:06:16.045
We have to stop ISDA's out-of-control
behavior, and rescue the Dragons.

00:06:16.045 --> 00:06:18.215
For the sake of our future.

00:06:18.215 --> 00:06:19.845
Right!

00:06:21.155 --> 00:06:25.055
Oh, come to think of it, where's Gio?

00:06:25.055 --> 00:06:27.525
He's gone missing.

00:06:27.525 --> 00:06:29.515
Gone missing?

00:06:32.095 --> 00:06:36.065
How could he go off somewhere
without saying a word?

00:06:36.065 --> 00:06:39.065
It won't do any good to keep
worrying about it, right?

00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:42.205
If it comes down to it,
I'll come up with something.

00:06:42.205 --> 00:06:44.905
Come on, drive this thing faster.

00:06:44.905 --> 00:06:48.745
As you wish, young lady.

00:06:48.745 --> 00:06:50.375
Gio...

00:06:53.015 --> 00:06:54.715
Toa?

00:06:54.715 --> 00:06:57.845
Jin, I...

00:07:02.425 --> 00:07:05.795
- Out.
- Widow?! Why, you!

00:07:08.595 --> 00:07:11.635
I only have business with the Dragons.

00:07:11.635 --> 00:07:13.225
Damn it!

00:07:16.205 --> 00:07:18.805
Where are you planning on taking them?

00:07:18.805 --> 00:07:23.575
Ask the commander.
I'm not authorized to tell you.

00:07:28.155 --> 00:07:30.245
Commander Sakaki?

00:07:36.225 --> 00:07:40.435
We'll be coming up on Tartarus'
territorial waters momentarily.

00:07:40.435 --> 00:07:42.095
Jin, everything ready?

00:07:42.095 --> 00:07:44.465
Okay. Get us started.

00:07:47.175 --> 00:07:49.665
Commence flooding container.

00:07:53.345 --> 00:07:57.245
You know, I'm surprised
you had this control gear.

00:07:57.245 --> 00:08:02.985
Yeah. I asked the Professor
to arrange for it, just in case.

00:08:02.985 --> 00:08:05.755
You were planning to go in it?

00:08:05.755 --> 00:08:07.125
You don't think I could?

00:08:07.125 --> 00:08:11.095
Of course not! You haven't
even had any training!

00:08:11.095 --> 00:08:13.285
S-Still...

00:08:15.935 --> 00:08:19.865
You couldn't work the controls,
with those in the way.

00:08:28.345 --> 00:08:32.285
We're counting on you, Jin, Toa.

00:08:32.285 --> 00:08:36.555
Are you sure about this, Toa?

00:08:36.555 --> 00:08:38.985
We're going to be saving everyone.

00:08:41.325 --> 00:08:46.385
We have to protect the ties
between Dragons and humans.

00:08:48.295 --> 00:08:53.825
- Ties...
- So I want to do whatever I can.

00:09:01.875 --> 00:09:06.715
Witness the real me, Jin.

00:09:06.715 --> 00:09:12.685
I give all that I am to you, Jin.
So, fight alongside me.

00:09:12.685 --> 00:09:15.195
Toa...

00:09:15.195 --> 00:09:18.165
To tell you the truth, I'm awfully scared.

00:09:18.165 --> 00:09:23.665
But with you by my side, Jin,
I'm sure it will be all right.

00:09:23.665 --> 00:09:25.265
Toa...

00:09:25.265 --> 00:09:26.895
Jin...

00:09:33.345 --> 00:09:35.215
Are we really doing this?

00:09:35.215 --> 00:09:38.745
It's the perfect thing to occupy
our time with until we find Jin.

00:09:38.745 --> 00:09:43.455
But to use them for Aegis tests...

00:09:43.455 --> 00:09:47.225
What's the matter? Are you
developing a guilty conscience now?

00:09:47.225 --> 00:09:50.565
It's not that.

00:09:50.565 --> 00:09:54.095
After all this, if it means
me going to hell, I'm still...

00:09:54.095 --> 00:09:56.635
Captain, we've received a
message from our patrol craft!

00:09:56.635 --> 00:09:59.625
There's an object approaching
Tartarus at high speed!

00:10:00.775 --> 00:10:03.035
Let's go, Toa!

00:10:06.605 --> 00:10:09.915
Tartarus is surrounded by a CSS field.

00:10:09.915 --> 00:10:13.085
- Be careful not to get too close.
- I know.

00:10:13.085 --> 00:10:15.555
All right, let's get going, too!

00:10:20.155 --> 00:10:22.955
Jin! It's Jin!

00:10:22.955 --> 00:10:25.755
You've come to me, haven't you, Jin?

00:10:27.965 --> 00:10:30.465
Communications with
Tartarus have been cut off.

00:10:30.465 --> 00:10:33.005
Isn't it dangerous to be going there?

00:10:33.005 --> 00:10:36.635
The attack is probably a diversion. No problem.

00:10:50.455 --> 00:10:52.515
Sending out the attack craft!

00:10:54.795 --> 00:10:57.455
What?! W-Who are you?!

00:11:00.765 --> 00:11:02.795
Don't go charging off so recklessly.

00:11:02.795 --> 00:11:06.805
You really are used to this. Who are you?

00:11:06.805 --> 00:11:09.035
A champion of justice!

00:11:09.035 --> 00:11:11.175
You sound ridiculous.

00:11:11.175 --> 00:11:13.875
- Hurry.
- What's that?

00:11:13.875 --> 00:11:17.285
CSS field neutralizing devices.

00:11:17.285 --> 00:11:20.455
Attach these to a Dragon,
and they should be able to use

00:11:20.455 --> 00:11:24.455
as much as 80% of their fighting ability.

00:11:24.455 --> 00:11:28.455
When we get Amadeus and the
others out, give these to them.

00:11:28.455 --> 00:11:30.625
When did you come up with those?

00:11:30.625 --> 00:11:33.895
We didn't hide out in the
electronics district for nothing.

00:11:33.895 --> 00:11:38.505
That's for sure. You don't strike
me as the retired electrician type.

00:11:38.505 --> 00:11:40.165
Let's hurry.

00:11:48.075 --> 00:11:50.235
Are you okay, Toa?!

00:11:54.385 --> 00:11:57.425
Jin! What happened to Gio?

00:11:57.425 --> 00:11:59.055
Kazuki...

00:11:59.055 --> 00:12:01.925
Thank goodness, you're still alive!

00:12:01.925 --> 00:12:03.755
Alive?

00:12:05.395 --> 00:12:09.225
You try to kill me, then ask if I'm still alive?

00:12:11.865 --> 00:12:15.605
There's no way I'm gonna
die until I've killed you!

00:12:15.605 --> 00:12:18.745
Every time this scar aches, I remember

00:12:18.745 --> 00:12:23.545
that cold, dark hell,
where I couldn't feel anything!

00:12:23.545 --> 00:12:26.285
I'll show it to you, too, Jin.

00:12:26.285 --> 00:12:29.775
You can die for the both of us!

00:12:31.855 --> 00:12:33.685
Stop, Kazuki!

00:12:49.375 --> 00:12:51.975
Whoa! Aren't you done yet?

00:12:51.975 --> 00:12:54.145
Just hush! Almost there!

00:12:54.145 --> 00:12:55.875
Hurry it up, will you?

00:13:01.755 --> 00:13:04.315
All right, not bad.

00:13:05.985 --> 00:13:07.645
I've found them!

00:13:09.625 --> 00:13:11.795
You got tired of Gio, so now it's Toa, huh?

00:13:11.795 --> 00:13:14.335
You've got no fidelity, Jin!

00:13:14.335 --> 00:13:16.635
Are you gonna dump Toa when
you're tired of riding her, too?

00:13:16.635 --> 00:13:18.795
I would never do that!

00:13:25.675 --> 00:13:27.665
Are you all right, Toa?!

00:13:28.845 --> 00:13:30.475
What's the matter, Jin?!

00:13:30.475 --> 00:13:33.315
You're gonna die if you don't
come at me like you mean it!

00:13:33.315 --> 00:13:37.185
Or is it that you don't want
to have Toa kill anyone?

00:13:37.185 --> 00:13:40.855
You still think so little of me, huh, Jin?

00:13:40.855 --> 00:13:44.295
I'm not out here fighting to hurt anyone!

00:13:45.865 --> 00:13:48.295
I just want to preserve the bond
between Dragons and humans!

00:13:48.295 --> 00:13:52.495
Cut the crap! You were the one who
tore apart the bond between me and Gio!

00:14:05.615 --> 00:14:07.685
Yo! Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:14:07.685 --> 00:14:10.115
- Yonamine!
- What are you doing here?

00:14:10.115 --> 00:14:12.715
I'll explain later. We're getting out of here!

00:14:18.065 --> 00:14:21.395
Where's Amadeus? Where did Amadeus go?

00:14:21.395 --> 00:14:24.235
- He was taken away.
- Where?!

00:14:24.235 --> 00:14:27.675
The lowest level? Damn that Sakaki!

00:14:27.675 --> 00:14:29.975
He's planning to use Aegis on them!

00:14:29.975 --> 00:14:32.145
Aegis?

00:14:32.145 --> 00:14:36.415
An ultra-high output directional
CSS field generator that we developed

00:14:36.415 --> 00:14:39.385
in order to keep Thanatos immobile.

00:14:39.385 --> 00:14:42.855
You mean, it's been completed?!

00:14:42.855 --> 00:14:45.055
If a live Dragon were subjected to it,

00:14:45.055 --> 00:14:47.025
they wouldn't stand a chance.

00:14:47.025 --> 00:14:49.555
How could they?

00:14:49.555 --> 00:14:54.355
The "Dragonauts" that we
were in no longer exists.

00:14:59.905 --> 00:15:03.205
Let's go, we're going to rescue them!

00:15:03.205 --> 00:15:06.505
This room is quite a bit bigger, isn't it?

00:15:06.505 --> 00:15:08.915
I wonder what they're planning to do.

00:15:08.915 --> 00:15:12.785
I do not feel very good about this.

00:15:12.785 --> 00:15:14.715
Commencing operation.

00:15:23.955 --> 00:15:26.695
I'm so... heavy!

00:15:26.695 --> 00:15:29.025
What is this?!

00:15:33.735 --> 00:15:36.905
No good, this is a totally
standalone-style bulkhead.

00:15:36.905 --> 00:15:38.605
It won't accept my commands.

00:15:38.605 --> 00:15:40.805
And the others are just up ahead, too!

00:15:45.315 --> 00:15:47.045
Professor!

00:15:48.885 --> 00:15:52.555
There is a way to save them.

00:15:52.555 --> 00:15:55.425
All of the power on Tartarus
is supplied by a reactor

00:15:55.425 --> 00:15:58.065
in the deepest underground section.

00:15:58.065 --> 00:15:59.725
If we are able to shut it down,

00:15:59.725 --> 00:16:02.495
all of Tartarus' facilities
would cease operation.

00:16:02.495 --> 00:16:07.835
Yeah, and the CSS field
around the island would be gone.

00:16:07.835 --> 00:16:11.805
If that happens, Amadeus and the
others could escape on their own!

00:16:11.805 --> 00:16:13.745
All right, let's hurry.

00:16:16.515 --> 00:16:18.105
Look out!

00:16:25.355 --> 00:16:28.415
- Lt's her!
- Go on ahead.

00:16:29.755 --> 00:16:33.425
- Professor?
- But you can't do this alone...

00:16:33.425 --> 00:16:36.295
Yonamine-kun, take good care of her.

00:16:38.605 --> 00:16:41.095
Don't you die now, Professor.

00:16:44.705 --> 00:16:48.435
I never imagined I'd have to use this.

00:16:55.785 --> 00:16:57.455
What?!

00:16:57.455 --> 00:17:02.655
That's surprising. ISDA has
perfected the same thing I did?

00:17:22.375 --> 00:17:25.145
Don't tell me... you're!

00:17:30.485 --> 00:17:32.225
Hurry, Sigelinde!

00:17:32.225 --> 00:17:36.425
This is nasty! What's with
all these massive firewalls?

00:17:36.425 --> 00:17:39.095
It's too much.

00:17:39.095 --> 00:17:43.335
You're the only one who
can help the Dragons now!

00:17:43.335 --> 00:17:45.065
But...

00:17:45.065 --> 00:17:47.835
Believe in yourself, Sigelinde.

00:17:47.835 --> 00:17:51.345
You're the Dragonauts' most gifted member.

00:17:51.345 --> 00:17:53.745
Y-You don't have to remind me!

00:17:56.275 --> 00:17:58.075
Output up.

00:18:01.455 --> 00:18:03.515
Otohime!

00:18:03.515 --> 00:18:09.125
Sakaki is wrong. You have to realize that.

00:18:09.125 --> 00:18:14.935
You saw them, didn't you?
Risking their lives for the Dragons?

00:18:14.935 --> 00:18:20.365
We did not go through Resonance
with mankind for us to hate each other.

00:18:20.365 --> 00:18:22.705
- Not interested.
- What?

00:18:23.935 --> 00:18:25.535
Stop!

00:18:29.475 --> 00:18:30.915
KO!

00:18:30.915 --> 00:18:32.545
Damn!

00:18:48.295 --> 00:18:51.095
Toa... Toa!

00:18:55.905 --> 00:18:57.565
Kazuki...

00:19:01.275 --> 00:19:03.915
Output has reached critical.

00:19:03.915 --> 00:19:07.115
I'm sorry... Itsuki...

00:19:08.455 --> 00:19:10.655
This is the end, huh?

00:19:10.655 --> 00:19:13.645
Young... Miss...

00:19:16.025 --> 00:19:17.855
Amadeus!

00:19:22.935 --> 00:19:25.465
What?!

00:19:25.465 --> 00:19:27.465
Bring up the emergency power supply!

00:19:27.465 --> 00:19:29.675
I can't! The backups are down, too!

00:19:29.675 --> 00:19:32.975
Damn it, our Aegis test data will be...

00:19:36.975 --> 00:19:39.535
Incarnate!

00:19:41.185 --> 00:19:43.615
What happened?

00:19:43.615 --> 00:19:45.285
Don't move!

00:19:51.825 --> 00:19:53.485
What is that?

00:19:59.035 --> 00:20:01.135
Young Miss!

00:20:01.135 --> 00:20:03.305
Amadeus!

00:20:03.305 --> 00:20:05.505
Welcome back, Amadeus!

00:20:05.505 --> 00:20:10.345
That's too kind of you to say, Young Miss.

00:20:12.345 --> 00:20:15.515
It's over, Jin.

00:20:15.515 --> 00:20:17.175
Die.

00:20:22.225 --> 00:20:23.885
What?!

00:20:26.665 --> 00:20:28.895
Looks like they made it in time.

00:20:28.895 --> 00:20:32.065
Professor! Are you all right?!

00:20:32.065 --> 00:20:35.005
I'm doing just fine.

00:20:35.005 --> 00:20:36.775
Wait!

00:20:36.775 --> 00:20:42.615
You must not go back to Sakaki!
He will only bring you sadness!

00:20:42.615 --> 00:20:44.215
Raum!

00:20:44.215 --> 00:20:46.045
Raum?

00:20:54.085 --> 00:20:55.785
Here it comes.

00:20:57.095 --> 00:20:58.855
Stay out of my way!

00:21:23.785 --> 00:21:25.985
Gio...

00:21:25.985 --> 00:21:27.925
You came for us?!

00:21:50.445 --> 00:21:52.145
Gio...

00:21:53.585 --> 00:21:55.275
Are you?

00:22:19.345 --> 00:22:21.615
Hakisuteta kotoba no imi sae

00:22:21.615 --> 00:22:23.875
fukaku kangaetari wa shinai

00:22:23.875 --> 00:22:28.215
ima wo tada nigekiru dake

00:22:28.215 --> 00:22:30.485
Mata nannimo nakatta you ni

00:22:30.485 --> 00:22:32.625
onaji koto wo kurikaeshite'ru

00:22:32.625 --> 00:22:36.295
Muimi nano yo mata sonna nige

00:22:36.295 --> 00:22:45.165
Kekkyoku youchi de kodomo no manma da ne

00:22:45.165 --> 00:22:54.575
Hitori yogari kako no jibun wa mou sute na

00:22:54.575 --> 00:22:59.085
Tadashii tatakai wa
sou kimi no naka de hajimaru

00:22:59.085 --> 00:23:03.515
Kimi nara dou suru? Mou girigiri ja nai?

00:23:03.515 --> 00:23:08.595
Houkai shite shimau mae ni arubeki sugata wo

00:23:08.595 --> 00:23:15.695
omoiokoshite mite mi na yo

00:23:15.695 --> 00:23:21.825
Fight or flight

00:23:24.505 --> 00:23:29.275
Fight or flight

00:23:42.125 --> 00:23:45.065
All righty, nobody is around.
Now to do the preview, while I can.

00:23:45.065 --> 00:23:47.125
Oh, no you don't, Captain!

00:23:47.125 --> 00:23:48.865
Sakaki-kun? When did you get here?

00:23:48.865 --> 00:23:52.435
I can't have you forgetting about me, either.

00:23:52.435 --> 00:23:54.105
Professor Nozaki! You, too?!

00:23:54.105 --> 00:23:57.705
Please, let me do it!
I've always wanted to do this!

00:23:57.705 --> 00:23:59.905
No, you don't! Next time...

00:23:59.905 --> 00:24:02.915
"It," of all things, returns!

00:24:02.915 --> 00:24:05.915
Ah! Please, don't take our jobs away from us!

00:24:05.915 --> 00:24:07.975
Saki-kun, where are your clothes?
